          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149449,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando codificamos a tag semântica para um elemento, não precisamos do atributo <code>role</code>. O que há de errado com este código?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"role\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;button&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start level\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não precisamos do atributo <code>role</code> em um elemento <code>button</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Não precisamos da tag <code>button</code> em um elemento <code>button</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não precisamos do atributo <code>role</code> em um elemento <code>button</code>.</p></body></html>"
